 ('Reading · A recipe',text('Recipe: A Socratic Seminar (Serves Twelve)',['**Ingredients:** one short text; twelve curious people; a **pinch of doubt**; two **open-ended** questions; one chair per guest; **unlimited patience**. **Preparation time:** 20 minutes. **Seminar time:** 60 minutes.','**Method.** **Arrange** the chairs in a circle. **Read** the text aloud, **then let it rest** for a full minute. **Pose** your first question and **resist** the urge to answer it. **Season to taste** with follow-ups: “What do you mean by…?” **Simmer** until two guests disagree **politely**. **Serve** with an exit slip. **Do not** hurry; the dish is **spoiled** by **tidy conclusions**.'],kicker='RECIPE',by='The Slow Seminar Cookbook',gloss=[('pinch','pitada'),('simmer','cozinhar em fogo baixo'),('season','temperar'),('spoil','estragar')])),
